<title>NETHERLANDS: RODAMCO RETAIL Q1 NET PROFIT RISES 5 PCT.</title>
<headline>RODAMCO RETAIL Q1 NET PROFIT RISES 5 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>First qtr to May 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    12.9   vs  12.3</p>
<p>    Net profit per share (guilders)  1.70  vs   1.63</p>
<p>    Property revaluation gain	  3.5   vs   nil</p>
<p>    Net asset value/shr (guilders) 106.96  vs 104.86</p>
<p>NOTE - Property investment fund Rodamco Retail Nederland NV</p>
<p>previously said it was positive on the expected profits</p>
<p>generated during the financial year 1997/98.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
